    "created_at": "2018-02-16T16:22:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-16T16:22:38Z",
    "body": "The question is really how many places sniff. If this is all local to the font loader, it could just perform the sniffing and dispatch to the appropriate parser algorithm. You shouldn't need a MIME type to find a parser algorithm, generally.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
