    "created_at": "2018-02-16T17:29:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-16T17:29:14Z",
    "body": "Maybe, I'm still a little unsure if font sniffing should be in this specification at all if the only caller is the font loader. Though maybe it makes more sense with the cross-origin thingy Chrome is working on?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
