    "created_at": "2019-10-31T14:42:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-10-31T14:42:42Z",
    "body": "Is there a conclusion on font MIME type sniffing? @annevk  If it is not used, should this issue be closed?\r\n\r\nbtw Font MIME types defined in [RFC 8081: The \"font\" Top-Level Media Type](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc8081)",
