    "created_at": "2019-10-31T17:48:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-10-31T17:48:38Z",
    "body": "Tentatively, since fonts always use CORS, it matters less that they are sniffed for CORB/Spectre purposes. The actual sniffing should be defined as part of the font loader I think, which I guess would be part of some CSS font specification.",
